      "sourceTextSha256": "cd10ef127479b1c9f357f13cbeb6597d228cbf48a2c9b1e55cf9e8978d15bab9",
      "text": "Enjoy a full day aboard a private 30-ft luxury boat.\n Cruise across turquoise glacial waters, stop at remote beaches, swim, or enjoy SUP boards included on board.\n Your gourmet catering choice—such as sushi, ribeye steak, or cheese & smoked platter—will be paired with premium Argentine wine.\n As the sun sets, enjoy Bosque Gin cocktails and a cheese platter.\n Return to the chalet for a restful evening.",
